---
// Viewport Digital LLC - Commercial & Portrait Photography Suites
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<title>Commercial & Portrait Media Suites | Viewport Digital LLC</title>
		<style>
			:root {
				color-scheme: dark;
				--bg-canvas: #060911;
				--surface-glass: #0b101c;
				--surface-glass-hover: #131b2e;
				--accent-blue: #2563eb;
				--accent-blue-hover: #1d4ed8;
				--text-primary: #F8FAFC;
				--text-secondary: #94A3B8;
				--border-frost: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
			}

			* { box-sizing: border-box; letter-spacing: -0.015em; }

			body {
				margin: 0;
				font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
				background-color: var(--bg-canvas);
				color: var(--text-primary);
				line-height: 1.6;
				-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
			}

			header {
				position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
				backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
				-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
				background-color: rgba(6, 9, 17, 0.9);
				border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-frost);
			}

			.container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }

			.header-content {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: space-between;
				height: 76px;
			}

			.brand-wrap {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 12px;
				text-decoration: none;
			}

			.logo-img {
				width: 36px;
				height: 36px;
				object-fit: contain;
				border-radius: 6px;
				background: #111827;
				border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
			}

			.brand-text {
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
			}

			.brand-title {
				font-weight: 800;
				font-size: 0.95rem;
				letter-spacing: 0.08em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				color: #fff;
				line-height: 1.1;
			}

			.brand-subtitle {
				font-size: 0.65rem;
				font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 0.15em;
				color: var(--text-secondary);
				margin-top: 2px;
			}

			/* Sandwich Menu Button */
			.hamburger {
				width: 44px;
				height: 44px;
				background: var(--surface-glass);
				border: 1px solid var(--border-frost);
				border-radius: 8px;
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				gap: 5px;
				cursor: pointer;
				padding: 0;
				z-index: 101;
			}

			.hamburger span {
				width: 18px;
				height: 2px;
				background-color: var(--text-primary);
				transition: all 0.3s ease;
			}

			/* Full-Screen Mobile Drawer Menu */
			.mobile-drawer {
				position: fixed;
				top: 0;
				left: 0;
				width: 100%;
				height: 100vh;
				background-color: #04060b;
				padding: 24px 20px;
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				z-index: 1000;
				opacity: 0;
				pointer-events: none;
				transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
			}

			.mobile-drawer.active {
				opacity: 1;
				pointer-events: auto;
			}

			.drawer-header {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: space-between;
				height: 52px;
				margin-bottom: 40px;
			}

			.close-btn {
				width: 40px;
				height: 40px;
				background: var(--surface-glass);
				border: 1px solid var(--border-frost);
				border-radius: 8px;
				color: #fff;
				font-size: 1.25rem;
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				cursor: pointer;
			}

			.drawer-nav {
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				gap: 28px;
				margin-bottom: 40px;
			}

			.drawer-nav a {
				color: #fff;
				text-decoration: none;
				font-weight: 700;
				font-size: 1.15rem;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 0.08em;
				transition: color 0.2s;
			}

			.drawer-nav a:hover, .drawer-nav a.active {
				color: var(--accent-blue);
			}

			.drawer-cta {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				width: 100%;
				padding: 16px;
				background-color: var(--accent-blue);
				color: #fff;
				font-weight: 700;
				font-size: 0.9rem;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 0.08em;
				text-decoration: none;
				border-radius: 8px;
				box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.4);
			}

			.archival-tag {
				font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 0.15em; color: var(--accent-blue); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px;
			}
			.archival-tag::before { content: "■"; font-size: 0.5rem; }

			.btn-primary {
				display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 14px 28px;
				background-color: var(--accent-blue); color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem;
				text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; transition: all 0.3s ease; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3);
			}
			.btn-primary:hover { background-color: var(--accent-blue-hover); transform: translateY(-2px); }

			.btn-outline {
				display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 12px 24px;
				background-color: var(--surface-glass); border: 1px solid var(--border-frost); color: var(--text-primary);
				font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; transition: all 0.3s ease;
			}
			.btn-outline:hover { border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); background-color: var(--surface-glass-hover); }

			section { padding: 80px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-frost); }
			.section-header { max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 48px; }
			.section-header h1, .section-header h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-transform: uppercase; }
			.section-header p { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 1rem; }

			.grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
			@media(min-width: 768px) { .grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }

			.grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
			@media(min-width: 768px) { .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }

			.glass-card {
				background: var(--surface-glass); border: 1px solid var(--border-frost);
				box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08), 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
				backdrop-filter: blur(20px); border-radius: 20px; padding: 36px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;
				transition: border-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
			}
			.glass-card:hover { border-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.4); transform: translateY(-2px); }

			.card-price { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin: 16px 0 8px 0; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
			.card h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 8px 0; }
			.card p { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 24px 0; }
			.card-tag { font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; color: var(--accent-blue); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }

			.features-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #cbd5e1; }
			.features-list li { padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); }

			.cta-bottom-card {
				background: var(--surface-glass);
				border: 1px solid rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3);
				box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1), 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
				backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
				border-radius: 24px;
				padding: 56px 32px;
				text-align: center;
				max-width: 800px;
				margin: 80px auto 0 auto;
			}

			footer { padding: 60px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-frost); text-align: center; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.85rem; }
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<header>
			<div class="container header-content">
				<a href="/" class="brand-wrap">
					<img src="/logo.svg" alt="Viewport Digital Logo" class="logo-img" onerror="this.src='/logo.png';" />
					<div class="brand-text">
						<span class="brand-title">Viewport Digital</span>
						<span class="brand-subtitle">Architectural Web</span>
					</div>
				</a>
				<button class="hamburger" id="menu-toggle" aria-label="Toggle Mobile Navigation">
					<span></span>
					<span></span>
					<span></span>
				</button>
			</div>

			<!-- Full-Screen Mobile Drawer Menu -->
			<div class="mobile-drawer" id="mobile-drawer">
				<div class="drawer-header">
					<a href="/" class="brand-wrap">
						<img src="/logo.svg" alt="Viewport Digital Logo" class="logo-img" onerror="this.src='/logo.png';" />
						<div class="brand-text">
							<span class="brand-title">Viewport Digital</span>
							<span class="brand-subtitle">Architectural Web</span>
						</div>
					</a>
					<button class="close-btn" id="menu-close" aria-label="Close Navigation">&times;</button>
				</div>
				<nav class="drawer-nav">
					<a href="/">Home</a>
					<a href="/#process">Our Process</a>
					<a href="/pricing">Tiers & Pricing</a>
					<a href="/photography" class="active">Commercial Media</a>
				</nav>
				<a href="/contact" class="drawer-cta">Contact / Let's Build &rarr;</a>
			</div>
		</header>

		<main class="container" style="padding-top: 56px; padding-bottom: 80px;">
			<div class="section-header">
				<span class="archival-tag">[INDEX // COMMERCIAL & PORTRAIT OPTICS]</span>
				<h1>Commercial & Event Media Suites.</h1>
				<p>High-end visual assets engineered to populate your digital properties and elevate your brand presence.</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Commercial Production Suites -->
			<h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 24px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Commercial Production</h2>
			<div class="grid-3" style="margin-bottom: 64px;">
				<div class="glass-card">
					<div>
						<span class="card-tag">Commercial</span>
						<h3>Web Asset Starter</h3>
						<div class="card-price">$350 flat</div>
						<p>Natural pairing for single-page builds. 1 hour on-site, 10 to 15 fully edited, web-optimized files.</p>
						<ul class="features-list">
							<li>1 hour on-site capture</li>
							<li>10 to 15 web-optimized files</li>
							<li>Immediate component drop-in</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
						<span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #34D399; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;">Bundle Discount: Save $150 with web dev</span>
						<a href="/contact" class="btn-outline" style="text-align: center;">Book Commercial</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="glass-card" style="border-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.4);">
					<div>
						<span class="card-tag" style="color: var(--accent-blue);">Commercial • Most Popular</span>
						<h3>Full Brand Suite</h3>
						<div class="card-price">$750 flat</div>
						<p>Half-day commitment for multi-page cores. Action shots, crew workflow, interior details, and curb appeal.</p>
						<ul class="features-list">
							<li>Half-day on-site commitment</li>
							<li>30 to 40 fully edited operational assets</li>
							<li>Action & team workflow optics</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
						<span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #34D399; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;">Bundle Discount: Save $150 with web dev</span>
						<a href="/contact" class="btn-primary" style="text-align: center;">Book Brand Suite</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="glass-card">
					<div>
						<span class="card-tag">Commercial</span>
						<h3>Full-Day Production</h3>
						<div class="card-price">$1,500+</div>
						<p>Heavy lifting. Full day on-site, complex lighting setups, multi-room facilities, and deep inventory catalogs.</p>
						<ul class="features-list">
							<li>Full day on-site commitment</li>
							<li>Complex multi-light studio setups</li>
							<div>Exhaustive facility & catalog delivery</div>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
						<span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #34D399; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;">Bundle Discount: Save $150 with web dev</span>
						<a href="/contact" class="btn-outline" style="text-align: center;">Book Full-Day</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Family & Portrait Sessions -->
			<h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 24px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Family & Portrait Sessions</h2>
			<div class="grid-2" style="margin-bottom: 64px;">
				<div class="glass-card">
					<div>
						<span class="card-tag">Portraits</span>
						<h3>The Essentials Mini-Session</h3>
						<div class="card-price">$175</div>
						<p>A 30-minute block at a single local spot like Tarkington Park or a clean outdoor backdrop.</p>
						<ul class="features-list">
							<li>30-minute targeted shooting block</li>
							<li>Single local backdrop (e.g., Tarkington Park)</li>
							<li>10 to 15 polished digital files via online gallery</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<a href="/contact" class="btn-outline" style="text-align: center;">Book Mini-Session</a>
				</div>

				<div class="glass-card">
					<div>
						<span class="card-tag">Portraits</span>
						<h3>The Full Family Story</h3>
						<div class="card-price">$325</div>
						<p>Up to 90 minutes of shooting time with multiple outfit swaps and family grouping flexibility.</p>
						<ul class="features-list">
							<li>Up to 90 minutes shooting time</li>
							<li>Multiple outfit swaps & location flexibility</li>
							<li>Coverage for up to 5 members ($25 per extra person)</li>
							<li>30 to 40 fully edited high-res images</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<a href="/contact" class="btn-outline" style="text-align: center;">Book Family Story</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Private Events & Parties -->
			<h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 24px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Private Events & Parties</h2>
			<div style="margin-bottom: 64px;">
				<div class="glass-card" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
					<div>
						<span class="card-tag">Events</span>
						<h3>Hourly Event Coverage</h3>
						<div class="card-price">$150 / hour <span style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 400;">(2-hour minimum)</span></div>
						<p>Built for birthday parties, milestones, family reunions, and local gatherings across central Indiana.</p>
						<ul class="features-list">
							<li>Candid guest moments & dynamic action shots</li>
							<li>Detailed environmental & venue coverage</li>
							<li>Rapid gallery turnaround for social/print</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<a href="/contact" class="btn-primary" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 16px;">Book Event Coverage</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Weddings & Elopements -->
			<h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 24px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Weddings & Elopements</h2>
			<div class="grid-2" style="margin-bottom: 64px;">
				<div class="glass-card">
					<div>
						<span class="card-tag">Weddings</span>
						<h3>The Intimate & Elopement Tier</h3>
						<div class="card-price">$1,200</div>
						<p>Up to 4 hours of coverage tailored for courthouse ceremonies or intimate celebrations around central Indiana.</p>
						<ul class="features-list">
							<li>Up to 4 hours of dedicated storytelling coverage</li>
							<li>Ceremony, portraits, and family formals</li>
							<li>Complete digital delivery with full print rights</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<a href="/contact" class="btn-outline" style="text-align: center;">Secure Elopement Date</a>
				</div>

				<div class="glass-card" style="border-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.4);">
					<div>
						<span class="card-tag" style="color: var(--accent-blue);">Weddings • Flagship Tier</span>
						<h3>The Full-Day Wedding Package</h3>
						<div class="card-price">$2,200</div>
						<p>Positioned below local Indianapolis baselines ($2,600 – $4,800) to secure early client momentum without sacrificing craft.</p>
						<ul class="features-list">
							<li>Up to 8 hours of comprehensive wedding day storytelling</li>
							<li>Pre-wedding timeline planning & shot list assistance</li>
							<li>Full high-resolution digital gallery download</li>
							<li>Full print & sharing rights included</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<a href="/contact" class="btn-primary" style="text-align: center;">Secure Wedding Date</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Bottom CTA Block -->
			<div class="cta-bottom-card">
				<span style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: var(--accent-blue);">Ready to Capture Your Story?</span>
				<h2 style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin: 12px 0 16px 0; text-transform: uppercase;">Have a session in mind?<br>Let's shoot.</h2>
				<p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 32px auto;">
					Zero sales friction. Submit your event date, portrait requirements, or commercial scope directly into our dispatch pipeline.
				</p>
				<a href="/contact" class="btn-primary" style="padding: 16px 36px; font-size: 0.95rem;">
					Book Your Session &rarr;
				</a>
			</div>
		</main>

		<footer>&copy; 2026 Viewport Digital LLC. All rights reserved. kiimon@viewportdigitalmedia.com</footer>

		<!-- Mobile Drawer Script -->
		<script>
			const toggle = document.getElementById('menu-toggle');
			const closeBtn = document.getElementById('menu-close');
			const drawer = document.getElementById('mobile-drawer');

			toggle?.addEventListener('click', () => {
				drawer?.classList.add('active');
			});

			closeBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
				drawer?.classList.remove('active');
			});
		</script>
	</body>
</html>
